ars, the duo of Ben Easton and Dottie has created one of the most distinctive new projects on the contemporary alternative scene, and following a series of acclaimed singles and sold-out concerts, they will bring their intense and emotional live show to Prague.","Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://www.livenation.cz/event/deary-prague-tickets-edp1658298","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:57:48.285Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T03:20:54.121Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T03:20:54.129Z","Tag":"LIVE","stableId":493},{"id":572,"documentId":"ov72nktaa34vm0mzcva7jnew","Title":"Iluka","Link":"https://www.facebook.com/events/1078207955130407","Date":"2027-03-13","Inverse":false,"Description":"Iluka is an Australian born, Los Angeles based singer/songwriter whose career has taken off over the last year with a string of viral songs that have quickly landed her a cult following. Defined by a raspy vocal and a cowgirl twang, with the addition of her signature style she is shaking up all the right elements of a uniquely crafted artistic cocktail.","Subtitle":null,"Tickets":null,"createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:57:49.193Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T03:22:12.509Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-18T03:22:12.519Z","Tag":null,"stableId":553},{"id":573,"documentId":"uxh64615q40dwk1dblalwosl","Title":"GHØSTKID (DE) : Follow The White Rabbit tour + Dropout Kings, Stain the Canvas","Link":"https://fb.me/e/8kWF8oLVA","Date":"2027-04-11","Inverse":false,"Description":"Připravte se, tenhle chaos vás pohltí! GHØSTKID tvoří hudbu, která je střemhlavý pád do temnoty a agrese. Formace se vrátí 16. října 2026 do klubu Bike Jesus v doprovodu Dropout Kings a Stain The Canvas.\n\nProjekt GHØSTKID začal jako pseudonym Sebastiana \"Sushi\" Bieslera (dříve Eskimo Callboy). Rok 2024 byl pro projekt přelomový, když vydal album HOLLYWOOD SUICIDE. Každý track totiž vypráví příběh o úzkosti, vášni a neochvějném odhodlání, čímž dotváří mozaiku neotřelé hudební produkce. Deska je důkazem uměleckého zápalu GHØSTKID a silné osobnosti zpěváka Sushiho.\nČeští fanoušci si ho mohou pamatovat z Rock for People 2021 a 2024. Na pražských zastávkách ale doprovodil také Bad Omens nebo Of Mice & Men a v roce 2024 přivezl i svou sólo show.","Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://goout.net/cs/listky/ghostkid-follow-the-white-rabbit-tour/rbqmb/","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:57:48.542Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T08:37:58.957Z","publishedAt":"2026-09-23T08:37:58.964Z","Tag":null,"stableId":509},{"id":622,"documentId":"xf1ppxa9a5fwpzc2cslee8ub","Title":"Mietze Conte /live","Link":"https://fb.me/e/9N5WVMTXc","Date":"2026-10-29","Inverse":false,"Description":null,"Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://goout.net/cs/listky/mietze-conte/yfjmb/","createdAt":"2026-10-01T14:47:30.982Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-01T14:47:30.982Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-01T14:47:30.989Z","Tag":null,"stableId":621},{"id":624,"documentId":"dp4fdmk6rtp8y1h1zzx598p6","Title":"glitter.hit meets Transatlantic: Europa + Freestyler + Lux18 + Rama + domizako + TBA","Link":null,"Date":"2026-10-30","Inverse":false,"Description":null,"Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://goout.net/cs/listky/glitter-hit-meets-transatlantic-europa+freestyler+lux18+rama+domizako/mpunb/","createdAt":"2026-10-01T14:48:30.235Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-01T14:48:30.235Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-01T14:48:30.240Z","Tag":null,"stableId":623},{"id":628,"documentId":"yj5b0762hechbsx4x2eljqvw","Title":"ƑƩⱮӾႠӨⱤƩ: Ӈలҝลţల ርลไไĬתּဌ","Link":null,"Date":"2026-10-31","Inverse":false,"Description":null,"Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://ra.co/events/2531658","createdAt":"2026-10-01T14:22:54.843Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-04T14:42:56.705Z","publishedAt":"2026-10-04T14:42:56.714Z","Tag":null,"stableId":591},{"id":629,"documentId":"vbx69455s8m1lizie1cfx7tz","Title":"Desire & Johnny Jewel + support: Mothermary","Link":"https://fb.me/e/4z5kv4wFW","Date":"2026-11-15","Inverse":false,"Description":null,"Subtitle":null,"Tickets":"https://fource.cz/cs/events/desire-26/","createdAt":"2026-09-13T23:57:48.498Z","updatedAt":"2026-10-12